==English==

===Etymology===
From the {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|memento|mementō|remember!|lang=la}}, imperative form of {{term|memini|meminī|I remember|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-memento.ogg|Audio (US)}}
*: {{rhymes|ɛntəʊ}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|mementos|pl2=mementoes}}

# A [[keepsake]]; an object kept as a [[reminder]] of a place or event.
#: ''I kept the shell as a '''memento''' of my visit to the seashore.''

====Usage notes====
* The alternate spelling ''[[momento]]'' is so common, some references now no longer consider it a misspelling.

====Synonyms====
* [[keepsake]]

